013,67,94,26]],"links":[["Washington County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/idaho/washington-county"],["ARC or PLC in Washington County","/arc-plc/idaho/washington-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids, July to August is the driest pair at 0.93 inches of normal, and it came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 19% of normal in May to June and 161% in July to August. Grid 28855 had its driest year in 1966 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
